         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.34.0: Lists now act as logical groupings. Deleting a list or removing a membership keeps its objects in the collection. A separate Delete object action requires confirmation. Objects without list memberships remain available in All objects and are preserved when saving and exporting.
            </p>
